    "body": "Demo for `pushState`: https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=13881\nDemo for `location.hash`: https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/13897\n\nThe spec for `pushState` already says to optionally throw `SecurityError`, which WebKit and Gecko implement but not Chromium. For `location.hash` Gecko throws but not WebKit or Chromium.\n",
